LiteRT 95d3d567b (2026-11-17) "[litert / ml_drift] Cap Flash-Decode keys per
work item on Adreno OpenCL", verbatim (`git show --format= 95d3d567b`).
patch_c_api.sh section 10b adds it to the litert archive.
Gemma 4 at float32 on Adreno 830 failed at the first decode with OpenCL
"Invalid work group size: {64, 4, 1}" (Galaxy S25 Ultra, 2026-11-18). The fix
is ML Drift e420a73d9 (in the v0.20.0 ML Drift pin) + LiteRT b2008e798 (in the
LiteRT pin bf49eb62) + this commit, which is not in bf49eb62. Drop this patch
once the LiteRT pin contains 95d3d567b.

